# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# prefs: factory
# An application that asks again while its own panel is up gets the panel
# its newer question needs.  Editor keeps one note of which panel it asked
# for last, so an Open panel left standing under a Save As would otherwise
# hand Editor a file it then saved over.
wait 14
click 980 30
wait 4
menu-pick Documents
wait 4
menu-pick Editor
wait 90
expect-title Edit
click 60 8
wait 6
menu-pick Open…
wait 30
expect-title Open
note Save As asked while the Open panel stands turns the panel round
click-window Edit
wait 4
click 60 8
wait 6
menu-pick Save As…
wait 30
expect-title Save
expect-no-title Open
note and Open asked while the Save panel stands turns it back
click-window Edit
wait 4
click 60 8
wait 6
menu-pick Open…
wait 30
expect-title Open
expect-no-title Save
key Escape
wait 15
expect-no-title Open
click-window Edit
wait 6
key Escape
wait 20
expect-no-title Edit
quit
